# Who must approve a pull request (DevOps design §1.6). Every member may change any folder; this file
# only decides whose approval is required. Each changed file needs an approval from ONE owner of the
# last line that matches it, so a PR that changes frontend/ and backend/ needs both owners.
#
# Use real GitHub handles only: GitHub ignores an owner it does not know, and a path whose owners are
# all unknown is left with no required reviewer. Fill in a commented line when its owner is decided.

# ---- default (root files, docker-compose.yml, README, …): DevOps owner ----
